# sshd_config for the L3 SSH target (tests/target/Dockerfile).
#
# Deliberately mixed: most hardening directives are set to compliant values,
# and a few are not, so the live suite proves both PASS and FAIL verdicts.
# Known non-compliant here: PermitRootLogin (key-only root is needed to read
# this 0600 file), and Protocol / HostKeyAlgorithms are left unset.
# test_live_pipeline.py derives every rule's expected verdict from this file.
# One line per directive, no Include, so nothing else changes the values.

PermitRootLogin prohibit-password
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys
PermitEmptyPasswords no
HostbasedAuthentication no
IgnoreRhosts yes
StrictModes yes
UsePAM yes
X11Forwarding no
MaxAuthTries 4
MaxSessions 10
MaxStartups 10:30:60
LoginGraceTime 60
ClientAliveInterval 600
ClientAliveCountMax 0
LogLevel VERBOSE
Banner /etc/issue.net
Ciphers aes256-ctr,aes192-ctr,aes128-ctr
MACs hmac-sha2-512,hmac-sha2-256
KexAlgorithms ecdh-sha2-nistp256,ecdh-sha2-nistp384,ecdh-sha2-nistp521,diffie-hellman-group14-sha256,diffie-hellman-group16-sha512
Subsystem sftp /usr/libexec/openssh/sftp-server
